		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Gargantuan sea serpent with two arms and a scaled wolf's head. Its gullet is a pocket dimension with a unique ecology.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 40, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +6 (2d8 + swallow), <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Swallow</strong>. On a natural attack roll of 19-20, target is swallowed. Inside the belly is a sizable pocket dimension with an ecosystem of other swallowed creatures. Ketesthius regurgitates all swallowed if reduced to 0 HP.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
